      "title": "openvpn: fix sign comparison for wrapped client key length",
      "message": "openvpn: fix sign comparison for wrapped client key length\n\nUse uint32_t for wkc_len and data_len to eliminate signed vs unsigned comparison warnings with msg_length_remaining under -Wsign-compare.",
