      "title": "openvpn: validate wrapped client key length and report extra data",
      "message": "openvpn: validate wrapped client key length and report extra data\n\nValidate the wrapped client key (WKC) length in P_CONTROL_WKC_V1 and P_CONTROL_HARD_RESET_CLIENT_V3 messages to ensure it is at least 2 bytes and does not exceed the remaining message length. Report expert info ei_openvpn_wkc_length_bad on invalid length.\n\nReport expert info ei_openvpn_extra_data if unexpected extra data is found before WKC or in P_ACK_V1 packets.",
      "author_name": "meel-ayush",
      "author_email": "ayushmeel.dev@gmail.com",
      "authored_date": "2026-09-10T11:38:56.000+00:00",
      "committer_name": "meel-ayush",
      "committer_email": "ayushmeel.dev@gmail.com",
